<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Trash APIs on INFINI Pizza</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/</link><description>Recent content in Trash APIs on INFINI Pizza</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>List the cluster trash</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/list/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/list/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="list-the-cluster-trash">
 List the cluster trash
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#list-the-cluster-trash">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>List every node&amp;rsquo;s trash, merged into one cluster-wide, namespace-centric
view. The request may be sent to any node; the node that receives it
aggregates the trash of every cluster member.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /_cluster/trash
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>A typical item — here a deleted namespace held on two nodes:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;nodes_scanned&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;unreachable_nodes&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[],&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;retention_secs&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">86400&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;items&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;1788916375_namespace-website&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;deleted_at&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1788916375&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;bytes&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2097152&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;files&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">42&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;kind&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;namespace&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;namespace&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;website&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;collections&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;shard_groups&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">12&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;shard_copies&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">14&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;restorable&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">true&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;holders&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;node_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;…&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;node_name&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;pizza-1&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;bytes&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1048576&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;files&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">21&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">},&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;node_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;…&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;node_name&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;pizza-2&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;bytes&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1048576&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;files&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">21&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="request">
 Request
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#request">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /_cluster/trash
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="response">
 Response
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#response">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;code>items&lt;/code> — newest first; each item merges every node that still holds a
copy of the data into &lt;code>holders&lt;/code>.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>kind&lt;/code> — &lt;code>namespace&lt;/code> or &lt;code>collection&lt;/code>, parsed from the delete-time
snapshot. Items without a snapshot (legacy items swept by the orphan
scanner before snapshots existed, or a failed snapshot write) report
&lt;code>restorable: false&lt;/code> and cannot be restored.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>retention_secs&lt;/code> — the effective retention; items are physically
deleted once older than this.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>unreachable_nodes&lt;/code> — members that could not be reached; the list may
be incomplete for items they hold.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>Verify a trash item</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/verify/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/verify/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="verify-a-trash-item">
 Verify a trash item
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#verify-a-trash-item">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>Run a &lt;strong>read-only&lt;/strong> shard-completeness check on a trash item, across
every node that still holds its data. Nothing is moved or written — this
is the preflight for a 
 &lt;a href="https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/restore/">restore&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">POST /_cluster/trash/1788916375_namespace-website/verify
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>With &lt;code>?deep=true&lt;/code>, every present segment file additionally has its
footer parsed — truncated or corrupted files are reported by name.
Deep mode can take noticeably longer on large items.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;item&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;1788916375_namespace-website&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;deep&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">false&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;kind&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;namespace&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;namespace&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;website&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;restorable&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">true&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;degraded&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">false&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;shard_groups&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;collection&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;website:logs&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;shard&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;a1b2…&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;expected_copies&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;complete_copies&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;copies&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;node&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;…&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;node_name&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;pizza-1&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;primary&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">true&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;complete&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">true&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">},&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;node&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;…&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;node_name&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;pizza-2&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;primary&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">false&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;complete&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">true&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">],&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;issues&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[],&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;unreachable_nodes&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="request">
 Request
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#request">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">POST /_cluster/trash/&amp;lt;item&amp;gt;/verify&lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>?deep&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>true&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="path-parameters">
 Path parameters
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#path-parameters">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;code>&amp;lt;item&amp;gt;&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Required, string) The trash item name, as listed by

 &lt;a href="https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/list/">List the cluster trash&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2 id="response">
 Response
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#response">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;code>restorable&lt;/code> — &lt;code>true&lt;/code> when every shard group with recorded data has at
least one complete copy on some node. A shard group counts a copy as
complete when its allocation directory AND its segment manifest with
all declared local files are present (and, in deep mode, every file&amp;rsquo;s
footer parses).&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>degraded&lt;/code> — &lt;code>true&lt;/code> when the item is restorable but some recorded
copies are missing; the restore comes back with fewer replicas, which
the allocator backfills.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>issues&lt;/code> — human-readable problem lines (missing directories,
missing/corrupt segment files, unreachable nodes), each prefixed with
the node it applies to.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>Restore a trash item</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/restore/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/restore/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="restore-a-trash-item">
 Restore a trash item
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#restore-a-trash-item">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>Restore a trashed collection — or a whole deleted namespace — back into
the cluster, cluster-coordinated: every holder node moves its copy of
the data back, the metadata is re-registered through Raft with the
ORIGINAL collection/rolling/shard UUIDs, and the recorded shard
placements are replayed so every engine re-opens its original working
directory with all documents.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Restore a deleted namespace under a new name (every collection comes
back inside it):&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Delete a trash item everywhere</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/delete-item/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/delete-item/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="delete-a-trash-item-everywhere">
 Delete a trash item everywhere
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#delete-a-trash-item-everywhere">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>Physically delete one trash item on every node that still holds it,
without waiting for the retention window. This cannot be undone.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">POST /_cluster/trash/1788916375_namespace-website/delete
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;deleted&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">true&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;item&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;1788916375_namespace-website&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;nodes&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="request">
 Request
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#request">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">POST /_cluster/trash/&amp;lt;item&amp;gt;/delete
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="path-parameters">
 Path parameters
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#path-parameters">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;code>&amp;lt;item&amp;gt;&lt;/code> &lt;br>
(Required, string) The trash item name, as listed by

 &lt;a href="https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/list/">List the cluster trash&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>Empty the trash everywhere</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/empty/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/empty/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="empty-the-trash-everywhere">
 Empty the trash everywhere
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#empty-the-trash-everywhere">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>Physically delete every trashed item on every node, without waiting for
the retention window. This cannot be undone.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">POST /_cluster/trash/empty
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;nodes&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;removed&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">5&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="request">
 Request
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#request">#&lt;/a>
